{# A VPNv4 route reflector usually has no VRFs. By default a router with VPNv4 drops every route whose route-targets no local VRF
   imports, which on a reflector means ALL of them. 'no bgp default route-target filter' turns that check off. The clear asks the
   peers to send their routes again so the change takes effect on routes that are already in the table. #}
router bgp 65000
{% if rollback %}
 no bgp default route-target filter
{% else %}
 bgp default route-target filter
{% endif %}
do clear ip bgp vpnv4 unicast * soft in
